#DESCRIPTION
Dissociative recombination O2+ + e -> O + O in a hybrid plasma (n_e = n_i).
k(Te) = 0.2 cm^3/s at the closure temperature Te = 0.8617 eV = 1e4 K, k*n0*T = 2.
Analytic: n(t) = n0/(1 + k*n0*t). n_e and Te must come from the hybrid
electron closure, not from UNIFORMSTATE.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
100.0                   xMin  [code units: 1 = lNormSI = 100 km; x ~ 1e7 m]
106.4                   xMax
-0.05                   yMin
 0.05                   yMax
-0.05                   zMin
 0.05                   zMax

#NCELL
